{"product_id":"the-joy-of-origami","title":"The Joy Of Origami","description":"\u003cp\u003eOrigami is the ancient Japanese art of paper folding that has enthralled people of all ages. A perfectly square piece of paper, a set of good instructions and a hard surface to fold against-that is all it takes to understand the secret of Origami-a few nifty folds can create endless possibilities. This book has a wide range of fabulous origami designs to be made, including Aeroplane, Flower Basket, Pop-up Greeting Card, Elephant, Joker, Peacock, Ladybird, Talking Crow and Balloon. It also has activities like Collage Work, Cut and Paste, Crushed Paper Art and Spray Paint. Follow the step-by-step visual instructions in this book carefully, then crease slowly, firmly and accurately to create beautiful lifelike models. This is The Joy of Origami.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:300 x 10  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Yukiko Kurosava \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9788180220678 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44462055915673,"sku":"BLK-3-9788180220678","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/8ec0c9056da4201494ddcdbbc4260939.jpg?v=1752150966","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-joy-of-origami","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}